gpu-switcher (0.1.0-23) unstable; urgency=low

  * Selection now mirrors the configured state: the radio selection is the
    configured card when known, otherwise auto; "Reset to auto" works when
    no GPUs are detected.
  * Journal read failures are reported separately from an unknown running
    primary.
  * Packaging: ship gpu_switcher/selection.py (was missing from the .deb);
    both build paths install the same file list; the .deb version is read
    from debian/control.

 -- wl04 <wl04@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 15:29:34 +0100

gpu-switcher (0.1.0-22) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial public release: GUI to switch the primary display adapter
    (GNOME/Mutter). Polkit-gated Apply / Reset to auto via a root
    D-Bus-activated helper, Reboot / Log out activation, GPU detection
    (running and configured primary), verification hint, en/ru i18n.
  * Packaging: Debian copyright and changelog files, postrm that leaves
    the managed udev rule and its backups in place on removal.

